SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0

Ordinary DNS over HTTPS and DNS over TLS resolvers a user may choose, with their operators, seats, endpoints,
bootstrap addresses and the facts of each card (logging, audit, filtering, policy), collected by the Datapavan
project from each operator's own pages and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0015 and ADR 0042. The pages are cited as
evidence; the logging and filtering statements are summarised in our own words and nothing is copied from them.
